    "Kevin Cheung is a London‑based Production Manager and Producer working across commercials, fashion, music and live events. He has delivered work for Nike, Apple, Chanel, adidas and Jaeger‑LeCoultre, with directors including Gabriel Moses, Rankin and Jordan Hemingway.",
